#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:1
msgid "快速入门"
msgstr "Quick Start"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:3
msgid "项目介绍"
msgstr "Project Introduction"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:5
msgid ""
"**Triton-"
"Ascend**是适配华为Ascend处理器的Triton优化版本，用于高效进行核函数自动调优、算子编译及部署，通过兼容Triton核心语法并针对昇腾NPU特性进行深度优化，能够帮助用户在昇腾平台上快速开发和部署高性能计算任务。"
msgstr ""
"**Triton-Ascend** is an optimized version of Triton adapted for Huawei "
"Ascend processors, used for efficient kernel auto-tuning, operator "
"compilation, and deployment. By being compatible with Triton core syntax and"
" performing deep optimization for Ascend NPU features, it helps users "
"quickly develop and deploy high-performance computing tasks on the Ascend "
"Platform."

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:7
msgid ""
"本文以**Ubuntu 22.04**环境下通过软件包部署方式在线安装并运行向量加法示例为例，指导用户快速上手使用**Triton-"
"Ascend**。如需体验更多安装方式请阅读[安装指南](./installation_guide.md)文档。"
msgstr ""
"This guide helps you quickly get started with **Triton-Ascend** by "
"installing and running the vector addition sample online through software "
"package deployment in an **Ubuntu 22.04** environment. For more installation"
" methods, refer to the [Installation Guide](./installation_guide.md) "
"document."

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:9
msgid "环境准备"
msgstr "Environment Preparation"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:11
msgid "**硬件要求**"
msgstr "**Hardware Requirements**"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:13
msgid "支持的操作系统：Linux（aarch64/x86_64）"
msgstr "Supported operating systems: Linux (aarch64/x86_64)"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:15
msgid "支持的Ascend产品：Atlas A2系列产品、Atlas A3系列产品、Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品"
msgstr ""
"Supported Ascend products: Atlas A2 series products, Atlas A3 series "
"products, Ascend 950PR&950DT series products"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:17
msgid "最小硬件配置：单卡32GB内存（推荐）"
msgstr ""
"Minimum hardware configuration: single card with 32GB memory (recommended)"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:19
msgid "**软件依赖**"
msgstr "**Software Dependencies**"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:21
msgid ""
"确定CANN、Python和TorchNPU软件版本并安装。其中，可以参考昇腾社区官网《[CANN快速安装](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)》完成驱动与固件安装。"
msgstr ""
"Determine the software versions of CANN, Python, and TorchNPU, and install "
"them. For driver and firmware installation, refer to the [CANN Quick "
"Installation](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download) guide on the Ascend "
"community official website."

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:23
msgid "CANN版本：9.1.0"
msgstr "CANN version: 9.1.0"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:24
msgid "Python版本：python3.11"
msgstr "Python version: python3.11"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:25
msgid "TorchNPU版本：2.7.1.post8"
msgstr "TorchNPU version: 2.7.1.post8"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:27
msgid "注：更多配套关系请参考[版本说明表](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)。"
msgstr ""
"Note: For more compatibility details, please refer to the [Version "
"Compatibility Matrix](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)."

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:29
msgid "快速安装"
msgstr "Quick Start Installation"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:31
msgid ""
"pip install triton-ascend --extra-index-"
"url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi"
msgstr ""
"pip install triton-ascend --extra-index-"
"url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:35
msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick Start"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:37
msgid "**运行tutorials中的向量加法示例验证结果**"
msgstr ""
"**Run the vector addition sample in the tutorials to verify the results**"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:39
msgid ""
"向量加法示例：[01-vector-add.py](../../third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-"
"add.py) 通过对比Triton算子与PyTorch原生计算的输出结果，证明昇腾NPU设备可正确调用Triton算子并保证计算精度。"
msgstr ""
"Vector addition sample: [01-vector-"
"add.py](../../third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py) compares the "
"outputs of the Triton operator and the native PyTorch calculation, "
"demonstrating that the Ascend NPU device correctly calls the Triton operator"
" and ensures calculation accuracy."

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:41
msgid "⚠️ 下述命令需在bash环境下执行。若使用POSIX sh，请将 `source` 替换为 `.`。"
msgstr ""
"⚠️ Run the following commands in a bash environment. If you use POSIX sh, "
"replace `source` with `.`."

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:43
msgid ""
"# 设置CANN环境变量（以root用户默认安装路径`/usr/local/Ascend`为例）\n"
"source /usr/local/Ascend/ascend-toolkit/set_env.sh\n"
"# 拉取triton-ascend源码仓及用例\n"
"git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git\n"
"# 运行tutorials示例\n"
"python3 ./triton-ascend/third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py"
msgstr ""
"# Set CANN environment variables (using the root user's default installation path `/usr/local/Ascend` as an example)\n"
"source /usr/local/Ascend/ascend-toolkit/set_env.sh\n"
"# Clone the triton-ascend source repository and examples\n"
"git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git\n"
"# Run the tutorials example\n"
"python3 ./triton-ascend/third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:52
msgid "观察到类似的输出即说明环境配置正确。"
msgstr ""
"Observing similar output indicates that the environment configuration is "
"correct."

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:54
msgid ""
"tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')\n"
"tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')\n"
"The maximum difference between torch and triton is 0.0"
msgstr ""
"tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')\n"
"tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')\n"
"The maximum difference between torch and triton is 0.0"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:60
msgid "下一步：从样例到完整开发"
msgstr "Next steps: From samples to full development"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:62
msgid "本页帮助您完成安装与首个样例验证。若希望继续上手算子开发全流程，可按下面路径推进："
msgstr ""
"This page helps you complete the installation and verify your first sample. "
"If you want to proceed with the full operator development workflow, follow "
"the path below:"

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:64
msgid "**算子开发**：按算子类型阅读 Vector / Cube / 融合开发教程，再对照典型样例修改 Kernel，完成开发、编译、验证闭环。"
msgstr ""
"**Operator development**: Read the Vector / Cube / fusion development "
"tutorials by operator type. Then modify the kernel by referring to typical "
"samples to complete the development, compilation, and verification closed "
"loop."

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:65
msgid "**自动调优**：使用 Autotune 选择合适的 Tiling 配置。"
msgstr ""
"**Autotune**: Use Autotune to select an appropriate tiling configuration."

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:66
msgid "**调试与调优**：掌握打印调试与性能采集方法。"
msgstr ""
"**Debugging and tuning**: Master print debugging and performance profiling "
"methods."

#: ../../zh/quick_start.md:67
msgid "**迁移与进阶**：从 GPU Triton 迁移到 Ascend，或查阅环境变量与编译选项。"
msgstr ""
"**Migration and Advanced Topics**: Migrate from GPU Triton to Ascend, or "
"refer to environment variables and compilation options."

